# Part of the WebAssembly/Docker port of Lua; same license as Lua (see the Copyright Notice in lua.h).
# The image needs only the sources, the makefile and testes/: nothing
# reads .git, the port's own files and the manual are not built, and
# objects, libraries and a lua left by a local build would make make
# skip the clang build
.git/
.github/
emscripten/
manual/
**/*.o
**/*.so
**/*.a
lua
